  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "READ ME",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Russell circumplex (1980): emotion = quadrant of AROUSAL (Y) × VALENCE (X).** Both axes are PERSONAL Z-SCORES centred on 0 (your own resting baseline = origin), sharing one scale (~[-1.5, +1.5]). Points are clamped to the ring so a large z stays on the circle instead of flying off-axis.\n\n- **AROUSAL** (Y): `z_filtered` - HRV+HR fused, personal z-score, Kalman-smoothed. 0 = resting baseline; >0 = more activated. **Validated, reliable axis.**\n- **VALENCE** (X): `valence_personal_60s` - WESAD PPG model, personally calibrated (neutral = measured resting median), 60 s smoothed. ⚠️ **Weak axis:** arousal-matched, PPG valence is only ~58% cross-subject at best (CASE), ~chance on VR (EEVR), and WESAD's apparent 82% is largely residual AROUSAL (HR), shown by SHAP. Treat valence as a low-confidence tendency, not a verdict. See the *Valence - 3 models* dashboard.\n- **Dead-band**: width = `valence_deadband` (0.5·your smoothed-valence spread) - measured, not invented.\n\nShown only after calibration locks."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Circumplex - blue=now (X=calibrated valence, Y=arousal). NW Fear/Anger · NE Happy/Excited · SW Sad/Bored · SE Calm/Relaxed.",
      "type": "xychart",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 18,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "biofizic-influx"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "biofizic-influx"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "queryType": "sql",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT x, y_ring, y_state FROM (SELECT 1.5*sin(g*0.0785398) AS x, 1.5*cos(g*0.0785398) AS y_ring, CAST(NULL AS DOUBLE) AS y_state FROM generate_series(0,80) AS t(g) UNION ALL SELECT GREATEST(-1.5, LEAST(1.5, v.valence_personal_60s)) AS x, CAST(NULL AS DOUBLE) AS y_ring, GREATEST(-1.5, LEAST(1.5, CAST(l.z_filtered AS DOUBLE))) AS y_state FROM biofizic_live l JOIN biofizic_legacy_valence_wesad v ON l.time = v.time WHERE l.z_filtered IS NOT NULL AND v.valence_baseline_ready >= 0.5 AND $__timeFilter(l.time)) u ORDER BY x"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "seriesMapping": "auto",
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "show": "points",
            "pointSize": {
              "fixed": 5
            },
            "axisGridShow": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "x"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": -1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "VALENCE personal z (neg ← 0 → pos)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "y_ring"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": -1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "AROUSAL personal z (calm ← 0 → activated)"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixed": "#cccccc",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "reference ring"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "y_state"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixed": "#3274D9",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "session state"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
